     '{\"category\":\"merkle_break\",\"severity\":10.0,\"signal\":1,\"source_id\":\"s3_star\",\"ts\":\"2026-07-17T05:58:07.297726Z\"}'
  3. ledger.db (LXC 104): 645 rows (was 551), MAX(ts)=2026-07-17T05:58:08Z (was Jul 11)
  4. New rows by type: 27 merkle_break, 27 cycle_summary, 18 emit_count_divergence, 16 semantic_divergence, 5 env_temp_divergence, 1 algedonic",
